    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_01",
      "hash64": "4A63BD332C8423A6",
      "text": "Ooohohoho!\\nOoohohohooo![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_02",
      "hash64": "4A63BC332C8421F3",
      "text": "Billy, sieh dir das an! Was für ein entzückender\\nVorgarten![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_01",
      "hash64": "2F7DE3952507E0F8",
      "text": "Meine liebste Onea, das ist doch kein Vorgarten.\\nDu stehst in der hiesigen Obstplantage![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_03",
      "hash64": "4A63BB332C842040",
      "text": "Ist das dein Ernst...?\\c\\nDiese paar Obstbäume sollen eine Plantage sein?\\nWie erfrischend bescheiden![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_04",
      "hash64": "4A63C2332C842C25",
      "text": "Danke, dass du mich korrigiert hast. Auf deine\\nEhrlichkeit ist Verlass![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_02",
      "hash64": "2F7DE6952507E611",
      "text": "Nicht der Rede wert, meine Liebste. Auch für\\nmich ist die Lebensweise des Pöbels noch ein\\r\\ngroßes Mysterium...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_05",
      "hash64": "4A63C1332C842A72",
      "text": "Hach ja, gewöhnliche Menschen sind mir einfach\\nein Rätsel...\\c\\nEs ist so aufregend, sie zu erforschen![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_06",
      "hash64": "4A63C0332C8428BF",
      "text": "Nanu? Wenn man vom Pöbel spricht...\\nDa ist unser mittelloser Liebling wieder![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_03",
      "hash64": "2F7DE5952507E45E",
      "text": "Oh, du hast recht. Wieder einmal kreuzen\\nsich unsere Wege![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_07",
      "hash64": "4A63BF332C84270C",
      "text": "Ich will noch mehr über dich und den Rest des\\nPöbels erfahren! Euch näherkommen![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_08",
      "hash64": "4A63C6332C8432F1",
      "text": "In diesem Sinne... Würdest du noch einmal gegen\\nmich kämpfen?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_04",
      "hash64": "2F7DE8952507E977",
      "text": "Da zeigt sich wieder dein größtes Laster, meine\\nliebe Onea! Du kannst einfach nicht anders,\\r\\nals andere durch einen Kampf kennenzulernen![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_09",
      "hash64": "4A63C5332C84313E",
      "text": "Ohoho... Bitte sag mir jederzeit Bescheid,\\nwenn du deine Vorbereitungen getroffen hast.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_npc",
      "hash64": "C7A9B36FA70B1822",
      "text": "Du wirst nicht oft die Gelegenheit haben, gegen\\nso einen VIP zu kämpfen. Sprich mit Onea![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_10",
      "hash64": "4A60B8332C81E550",
      "text": "Ich, Onea, fordere dich zum Kampf heraus!\\nNimmst du die Herausforderung an?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_11",
      "hash64": "4A60B9332C81E703",
      "text": "Wie äußerst erquickend, einmal vom Pöbel auf\\ndie Schippe genommen zu werden...\\c\\nAber Zeit ist Geld, also Schluss mit den\\nSpielereien![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_12",
      "hash64": "4A60BA332C81E8B6",
      "text": "Bereite dich darauf vor, von der Geschäftsführerin\\nvon Paldea-Immobilien vernichtet zu werden![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_05",
      "hash64": "2F7DE7952507E7C4",
      "text": "Uh, là, là! Mach [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]ihnsie fertig, liebste Onea![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_13",
      "hash64": "4A60BB332C81EA69",
      "text": "Schon wieder besiegst du mich!\\nWer oder was bist du?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_14",
      "hash64": "4A60BC332C81EC1C",
      "text": "Sag mal, Billy, sind die Pokémon des Pöbels\\nimmer so stark? Oder ist dieses Exemplar hier\\r\\neine Ausnahme?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_06",
      "hash64": "2F7DEA952507ECDD",
      "text": "Wenn du mich fragst, hat [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ersie etwas, das nur\\nwenige Menschen des gemeinen Volks haben...[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_07",
      "hash64": "2F7DE9952507EB2A",
      "text": "Und zwar Ambitionen![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_15",
      "hash64": "4A60BD332C81EDCF",
      "text": "Ambitionen?! Du meinst diese Sache, die uns\\nVIPs ein Leben lang verwehrt bleibt?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_16",
      "hash64": "4A60BE332C81EF82",
      "text": "Deshalb konnte ich [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]ihnsie also nicht besiegen...\\nJetzt fällt es mir wie Triperlen von den Augen![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_17",
      "hash64": "4A60BF332C81F135",
      "text": "Wo wir gerade von Perlen sprechen...\\nIch glaube, das Wasser ruft mich, Billy![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_woman_18",
      "hash64": "4A60C0332C81F2E8",
      "text": "Als Nächstes will ich, dass du mir das [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]größte[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gewässer[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] in ganz Paldea zeigst![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_08",
      "hash64": "2F7DDC952507D513",
      "text": "Uh, là, là! Von deiner explosionsartigen Neugier\\nkönnten sich andere Jetsetter noch eine Scheibe\\r\\nabschneiden.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_006_man_09",
      "hash64": "2F7DDB952507D360",
      "text": "Dann gönnen wir uns mal eine gediegene Auszeit\\nam Strand einer Insel.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
